    "d4b8aabe-21f7-46cc-9876-084dcc983b66": {
      "type": "advanced-content",
      "blocks": {
        "liquid_etG6fY": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<center><h2>Elevate Your Workspace with Beveled Edge Glass Chair Mats</h2><p>Not all glass <a href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/collections/all\"><u>chair mats</u></a> are created equal, and the difference becomes obvious the moment you start rolling your chair.</p>\n<p>At Clearly Innovative, we&rsquo;ve redefined what a chair mat should be with our patented beveled edge design, engineered to deliver a smoother, safer, and more refined experience in any workspace.</p>\n<p>Whether you&rsquo;re dealing with resistance from plastic mats or frustrated with abrupt edges, our beveled edge glass chair mats solve these issues at the source. They enhance both performance and aesthetics while creating a more comfortable and efficient workspace.</p></center>",
            "width": "100%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        },
        "template--15945266593956__d4b8aabe-21f7-46cc-9876-084dcc983b66-1670457995c43d5970-1": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h2>What Is a Beveled Edge Glass Chair Mat?</h2><p>A beveled edge glass chair mat features a carefully angled edge that slopes gently toward the floor, rather than ending in a sharp, abrupt drop like standard mats.</p>\n<p>This design plays a critical role in improving everyday usability, something most traditional chair mats fail to address.</p>\n<p>This subtle but powerful design improvement creates:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>A seamless transition on and off the mat</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Reduced resistance when rolling your chair</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A safer surface for your feet and workspace</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A more refined, premium look</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>By eliminating harsh edges, beveled edge glass chair mats create a smoother interaction between your chair, your floor, and your movement.</p>\n<p>While many chair mats overlook this detail, we&rsquo;ve made it the cornerstone of our innovation.</p>",
            "width": "50%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        },
        "template--15945266593956__d4b8aabe-21f7-46cc-9876-084dcc983b66-1670457995c43d5970-0": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Drop-Off-Edge.jpg",
            "link": "",
            "width": "50%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        }
      },
