    "advanced_content_tYeJR4": {
      "type": "advanced-content",
      "blocks": {
        "liquid_KbeytB": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h2>Why Glass Outperforms</h2>\n<p>While beveled edges improve usability, the material itself determines long-term performance.</p>\n<p>Glass chair mats offer significant advantages over plastic alternatives:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Built to Last a Lifetime: </strong>Unlike plastic mats that crack, warp, or degrade over time, our tempered glass mats maintain their structure and clarity. With a lifetime warranty, replacement becomes unnecessary.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Smooth Rolling, Always: </strong>Plastic mats develop grooves that interrupt movement. Glass maintains a consistently smooth surface, ensuring uninterrupted rolling every day.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Crystal Clear Appearance:</strong> Plastic becomes cloudy and discolored. Glass remains clear, preserving the look of your flooring and overall workspace.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Stays Firmly in Place: </strong>Plastic mats shift and slide. Glass provides a stable, non-moving surface that supports consistent performance.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
            "width": "100%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        },
        "liquid_jbJdBb": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h2>The Benefits of Tempered Glass</h2>\n<p>Our chair mats are made from high-quality tempered glass, engineered for strength, safety, and performance.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Exceptional durability through heat-treated strengthening</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Scratch and impact resistance for long-term use</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>High load capacity, supporting heavy chairs and users</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Safe and reliable for everyday <a href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/blogs/news/how-glass-chair-mats-extend-the-life-of-your-home-office-flooring\"><u>office environments</u></a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Tempered glass combines strength with clarity, ensuring your chair mat performs reliably without compromising appearance.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        },
        "liquid_MtHyWc": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h2>Designed for <a href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/blogs/news/4-ergonomic-benefits-of-glass-office-floor-mats\"><u>Comfort and Ergonomics</u></a></h2>\n<p>A better chair mat improves how you move throughout your workday.</p>\n<p>Our beveled edge glass chair mats:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Reduce strain on your back and joints</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Enable smoother, more natural movement</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Eliminate resistance from worn-out plastic mats</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Support better posture and productivity</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When your chair moves effortlessly, your entire workspace becomes more efficient and comfortable.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        }
      },
