    "advanced_content_kPaX8N": {
      "type": "advanced-content",
      "blocks": {
        "liquid_9BMxRf": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h2>Protect Your Floors with Confidence</h2>\n<p>From hardwood and tile to carpeted surfaces, our glass chair mats provide a strong, protective barrier against wear and tear.</p>\n<p>They help:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Prevent scratches, dents, and damage</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Extend the life of your flooring</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Reduce maintenance and repair costs</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All while maintaining a clean, professional appearance that plastic mats cannot match.</p>\n<h2>A Stylish Upgrade for Any Office Space</h2>\n<p>When it comes to protecting your floors without compromising on design, a glass chair mat offers a level of sophistication that traditional plastic or vinyl mats simply can&rsquo;t match. Unlike opaque, curling mats that can make a workspace feel cluttered, glass delivers a clean, polished look that elevates the entire room.</p>\n<p>The transparent design works quietly in the background to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Showcase, not hide, your existing flooring</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Create a more open and spacious feel, perfect for smaller offices or home workspaces</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Complement any office d&eacute;cor, from sleek modern and minimalist to traditional or industrial</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>No matter your style, a glass chair mat integrates seamlessly into your environment, offering floor protection that looks as good as it performs.</p>\n<h2>An Eco-Friendly and Sustainable Choice</h2>\n<p>Choosing glass over plastic isn&rsquo;t just a design decision, it&rsquo;s a meaningful step toward sustainability.</p>\n<p>Our glass chair mats are thoughtfully crafted with the environment in mind:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Made from natural, silica-based materials which are abundant and non-toxic</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fully recyclable at end of life, unlike plastic mats that often end up in landfills</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Free from petroleum-based plastics and PVC, reducing reliance on fossil fuels</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>By switching to glass, you actively reduce waste while investing in a long-lasting, environmentally responsible solution that doesn&rsquo;t sacrifice performance for ethics.</p>\n<h2>Strength You Can Trust</h2>\n<p>Some assume glass means fragile, but our glass chair mats are engineered for heavy-duty performance. Whether you&rsquo;re rolling between tasks, sitting for long hours, or sharing a home office with family members, these mats handle real-world use with ease.</p>\n<p>Key durability features include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Supports up to 1,000 lbs, suitable for large office chairs and user weights</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Highly resistant to cracking, chipping, and daily wear with reinforced construction</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Backed by a lifetime warranty for complete peace of mind</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>From rolling desk chairs to standing desk stools, this is durability you can depend on every day&mdash;without the divots, dents, or discoloration that plague traditional mats.</p>\n<h2>A Seamless Experience with Every Movement</h2>\n<p>The combination of tempered glass strength and our patented beveled edge design creates a chair mat that feels effortless to use.</p>\n<p>No interruptions. No resistance. No uneven transitions.</p>\n<p>Just smooth, consistent performance that enhances your workflow and daily comfort.</p>\n<h2>Choose the Right Glass Chair Mat for Your Space</h2>\n<p>We offer a range of sizes and shapes to suit your workspace:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Rectangle glass chair mats</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Square glass chair mats</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Tabbed glass chair mats</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Each design maintains the same beveled edge precision and tempered glass durability, ensuring consistent performance across all options.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        },
        "liquid_nHRPkw": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<center><h2>Why Clearly Innovative?</h2>\n<p>We design every product with performance and long-term value in mind. Our patented beveled edge sets us apart, delivering a smoother, safer experience that standard mats cannot replicate.</p>\n<p>Our tempered glass chair mats are built to withstand daily use without cracking, bending, or discoloration. Backed by a lifetime warranty, they provide a dependable, long-term solution for any workspace.</p>\n<p>Recognized as the &ldquo;Best Glass Chair Mat in the United States for 2025,&rdquo; our products reflect a commitment to quality, innovation, and user-focused design.</p>\n<div class=\"blog-col blog-col-3\">\n<div class=\"blog-col-item\"><a title=\"Rectangle glass chair mats\" href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/products/rectangle-glass-chair-mats\"><img alt=\"Rectangle glass chair mats\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0613/0522/5380/products/CI_MAT-RECT-1_1600x2_135269a9-f3e9-4637-84b5-30ca1048b478_480x480.jpg?v=1680042337\"></a> <a title=\"Rectangle glass chair mats\" href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/products/rectangle-glass-chair-mats\">Rectangle Glass Chair Mats</a></div>\n<div class=\"blog-col-item\"><a title=\"Square glass chair mats\" href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/products/square-glass-chair-mats\"><img alt=\"Square glass chair mats\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0613/0522/5380/products/CI_MAT-SQUARE_LARGE_1600x3_b4304fe9-9fca-4786-802d-d67ddc34c243_480x480.jpg?v=1680042962\"></a> <a title=\"Square glass chair mats\" href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/products/square-glass-chair-mats\">Square Glass Chair Mats</a></div>\n<div class=\"blog-col-item\"><a title=\"Tabbed glass chair mats\" href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/products/tabbed-glass-chair-mat\"><img alt=\"Tabbed glass chair mats\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0613/0522/5380/products/CI_MAT-TAB_1600x2_22722df5-b21e-43e4-9850-b91c26e839f5_480x480.jpg?v=1680043005\"></a><a title=\"Tabbed glass chair mats\" href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/products/tabbed-glass-chair-mat\">Tabbed Glass Chair Mats</a></div>\n</div>\n<p><a title=\"Shop Now\" class=\"button btn\" href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/collections/all\">Browse our selection today</a></p></center>",
            "width": "100%",
