            "code": "<center><h2>Upgrade Your Workspace Today</h2>\n<p>Replace resistance, instability, and worn-out plastic mats with a solution designed for performance.</p>\n<p>Experience the difference of a beveled edge glass chair mat, engineered for smoother movement, safer transitions, and lasting durability.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/collections/all\"><u>Browse our collection today</u></a> and invest in a workspace that works as efficiently as you do.</p></center>",
