            "width": "100%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        },
        "liquid_aFHhf8": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<center><h3>Upgrade Your Office with Glass Today</h3><p>Take the next step in transforming your workspace by choosing glass. Experience the immediate benefits of glass enhancements and see how they can improve the functionality and style of your office. Browse our online store to start your upgrade and experience the difference firsthand. <a href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/pages/contact\">Visit our contact page</a> for other inquiries.</p></center>",
